SUMMARY:McGovern Centennial Gardens Volunteer Day
DTSTAMP:20260723T054505Z
DTSTART:20260725T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Saturday for hands-on gardening projects at the M
	cGovern Centennial Gardens. From 8 a.m. to 11 a.m.\, come help with season
	al tasks like planting\, weeding\, mulching\, and pruning. A great way to 
	connect with others and make a visible impact in the Park! \nNo experience
	 needed. All ages are welcome. \nMeet at the Family Garden in McGovern Cen
	tennial Gardens. \n Click here to sign up!\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/even
	t/mcgovern-centennial-gardens-volunteer-day-9/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conser
	vancy
